# Full trajectories: ~200KB per run, so a full matrix is hundreds of MB. The
# analysable ledger (results.jsonl) and manifest ARE committed — those are what
# a reader needs to check a claim. Traces stay local and are published as a
# separate corpus when results are, per spec §6.4 deliverable 6.
traces/
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
build/
dist/
